            "description": "===========\r\nAudit Trail\r\n===========\r\n\r\nAFEX Audit Trail is a Django app to create activities log and users' notifications. For every request,\r\na log of the body of request and response.\r\n\r\nDetailed documentation is in the \"docs\" directory.\r\n\r\nQuick start\r\n-----------\r\n\r\n1. Add \"audit_trail\" to your INSTALLED_APPS setting like this::\r\n\r\n    INSTALLED_APPS = [\r\n        ...\r\n        'audit_trails',\r\n    ]\r\n\r\n2. Include the audit_trail URLconf in your project urls.py like this::\r\n\r\n    path('audit_trails/', include('audit_trails.urls')),\r\n\r\n3. Run ``python manage.py migrate`` to create the ActivityLog and Notification models.\r\n\r\n4. Visit http://127.0.0.1:8000/notifications/ to list of notifications.\r\n",
